{"speciesId":690,"names":{"fr":"Venalgue","es":"Skrelp","en":"Skrelp","ja":"クズモー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se cache parmi les algues en décomposition pour mieux approcher ses proies, qu’il achève en les aspergeant de poison."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Adopta la apariencia de algas podridas y lanza un líquido venenoso a las presas desprevenidas que pasan cerca."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Camouflaged as rotten kelp, they spray liquid poison on prey that approaches unawares and then finish it off."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"腐った 海藻に 擬態する。 気づかずに 近寄ってきた 獲物に 毒液を 浴びせて しとめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa ressemblance avec le varech pourri est confondante. Il se soustrait à l’attention de ses ennemis en attendant de pouvoir évoluer."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es idéntico a un alga podrida. Mientras burla al enemigo, acumula energía para evolucionar."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It looks just like rotten kelp. It hides from foes while storing up power for its evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"腐った 海藻に そっくり。 敵の 目を ごまかしながら 進化する 力を 蓄える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il se cache parmi les algues en décomposition pour mieux approcher ses proies, qu’il achève en les aspergeant de poison."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Adopta la apariencia de algas podridas y lanza un líquido venenoso a las presas desprevenidas que pasan cerca."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Camouflaged as rotten kelp, they spray liquid poison on prey that approaches unawares and then finish it off."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"腐った 海藻に 擬態する。 気づかずに 近寄ってきた 獲物に 毒液を 浴びせて しとめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sa ressemblance avec le varech pourri est confondante. Il se soustrait à l’attention de ses ennemis en attendant de pouvoir évoluer."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Es idéntico a un alga podrida. Mientras burla al enemigo, acumula energía para evolucionar."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It looks just like rotten kelp. It hides from foes while storing up power for its evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"腐った 海藻に そっくり。 敵の 目を ごまかしながら 進化する 力を 蓄える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il reste tapi au fond des océans, à l’abri des plus gros Pokémon. Il se nourrit principalement d’algues pourries."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Permanece escondido e inmóvil entre las algas para protegerse de Pokémon más grandes. Su principal sustento son las algas podridas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It vanishes into seaweed and remains perfectly still to avoid attacks from large Pokémon. Rotten seaweed is its main food source."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"藻屑に 紛れ 大きなポケモンに 襲われないよう じっと している。 腐った 海草が 主な エサ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Comme il n’est pas très bon nageur, il se contente de s’entortiller autour des algues. À Alola, on le trouve souvent près de Sinistrail."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sus dotes para el nado dejan que desear y se enrolla en las algas. En la región de Alola se le suele ver acompañando a Dhelmise."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It’s not good at swimming, so it clings to the seaweed. In the Alola region, it’s often found near Dhelmise."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"泳ぐのが 下手なので 藻屑に 巻きついている。 アローラ地方では ダダリンの そばで よく 見つかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il se mêle aux algues en décomposition flottant à la surface des océans afin de surprendre et de dévorer les Pokémon qui viennent s’en nourrir."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Vaga por el océano oculto entre las algas y da buena cuenta de los Pokémon que se acercan para alimentarse de ellas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It drifts in the ocean, blending in with floating seaweed. When other Pokémon come to feast on the seaweed, Skrelp feasts on them instead."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"藻屑に 紛れて 海を 漂い 海藻を 食べに来た ポケモンを しとめて ご馳走に するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ressembler à une algue en décomposition lui permet d’échapper à ses ennemis en se cachant au milieu des résidus de plantes aquatiques."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su aspecto de alga podrida le permite ocultarse entre los restos que flotan a la deriva y pasar desapercibido ante sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Skrelp looks like a piece of rotten seaweed, so it can blend in with seaweed drifting on the ocean and avoid being detected by enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"腐った 海藻に 似ているので 海を 漂う 藻屑の 中に 隠れて 敵の目を ごまかす。"}],"varieties":[{"id":690,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tail-whip","learns":[[15,"level-up",9],[16,"level-up",9],[17,"level-up",9],[18,"level-up",9],[20,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"acid","learns":[[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15],[20,"level-up",5],[25,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",10],[25,"level-up",10]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[15,"level-up",42],[16,"level-up",42],[17,"level-up",42],[18,"level-up",42],[20,"level-up",55],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",55],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[15,"level-up",32],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-u